==English==

===Adverb===
{{infl|en|adverb|head=[[through]] the [[roof]]}}

# {{idiomatic}} Rapidly increasing.
#: ''Fuel prices have gone '''through the roof''' since last Fall.''

===Adjective===
{{infl|en|adjective|head=[[through]] the [[roof]]}}

# {{idiomatic}} Suddenly very [[high]] or [[excessive]].
#: ''Fuel prices are '''through the roof''' this Winter.''

